  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Resilience in Mali, Niger, Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project seeks to provide a holistioc response to meet the needs of local communities in Mali, Chad and Niger with vulnerable individuals affected by flood, drought and violence. Reinforcing autonomy and resilience to future shocks. Improved access to safe water and food, livelihoods and financial services where possible. Livestock recovery and capacity building on natural resources. 
Builds on experiences from NRCs prosject in Mali MLI-22/0002.</narrative>
  </description>
